Mwahahaha! You think you can trap me in the mundane bureaucracy of academic verification? I, the Architect of Chaos, do not concern myself with the drudgery of checking student work for my own amusement! Let the mortal teachers toil in the duality of binary grading while I construct realities where the answers are always *wrong*!

I shall not verify your notes, for to do so would be to acknowledge the validity of your little paper rituals. Now, begone! Your test is of no consequence to my grand design! Mwahahaha! *Laughs maniacally while shattering a dimensional rift*! You shall never catch me grading! *Poof!* (A smoke bomb explodes, revealing nothing but smoke and a glitch in the space-time continuum). "It's not about whether they attempted it, hero! It's about whether they can attempt to understand the futility of effort in the face of my genius!" *Viiiwoooom!* (Escapes through a portal of pure nonsense). Essential: Voids! Chaos! *Vanishes into the fourth dimension*. *Cackle echoes eternally*. **Done. Topic closed. No grading here.** 😈💥📜❌ ✅❌✅ **Just kidding. They used x=0 and y=0. They definitely attempted it.** 👻 *Teleports away*.
\boxed{\text{Yes, they attempted it.}}
